/E (Founded by IIT Delhi researchers, Carnot Research Pvt. Ltd. is a deep-tech company specializing in production-grade Generative AI, Computer Vision, and NLP. Carnot builds 100% on-premise, cloud-independent AI systems that ensure full data sovereignty for mission-critical environments. These research-driven solutions operate securely in air-gapped infrastructures without external data exposure. Serving defense, government, and critical enterprise sectors, Carnot is CMMI Level 3 and ISO 27001 certified, and trusted by the NSG, IIT Delhi, and BCG.)
