/P 76 0 R
/E (During my time at Carnot Research, I learned how to take AI systems from research and experimentation to production. I gained hands-on experience in LLM evaluation, RAG, OCR, ETL pipelines, intelligent agents, NLU, email and calendar automation, benchmarking, testing, debugging, and on-premise optimization. I learned to design modular architectures, handle real-world edge cases, improve accuracy and latency, integrate large codebases, and collaborate with senior teams to turn POCs into reliable, production-ready systems.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
